                "text": "This week, the @WHO is considering two disastrous amendments proposed by @POTUS.\n\nThe amendments would allow the WHO to unilaterally declare a public health crisis in the U.S.\n\nYes, the same WHO who covered for China by denying their role in the origins of COVID-19.",
