                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a Congressional leader on mental health care and school safety, I will continue to champion these issues. I believe we can accomplish these goals while respecting the Constitution. I will always stand for the Constitutional Rights of every American, which is why I voted no.",
