                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Two years ago, @sethmoulton and I introduced legislation to designate 988 as the hotline for mental health crises.\n\nThis Saturday, it goes live and those in need will have access to free, professional help. I'm so proud to see this bill become a reality.\n\nhttps://t.co/JxHPR2JFfP",
