                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We all know to call 9-1-1 if our house is on fire. Starting tomorrow, we'll be able to call 9-8-8 if we or our loved ones are in a mental health crisis.\n\nThe work is far from over, but this new mental health option will save lives on day one.\n\nhttps://t.co/Ebq0BPJwIq",
