                "text": "It might not always get the spotlight on primetime cable, but I\u2019m thankful for my colleagues on both sides of the aisle who continue our quiet, yet critical work on mental health.\n\nThe fight is far from over, but we\u2019re eager to continue finding solutions.\n\nhttps://t.co/u9iLximupF",
