                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We are wholeheartedly committed to finding real-world, bipartisan solutions to help all Americans struggling with mental health challenges. And we will work tirelessly to uphold that commitment.\n\nhttps://t.co/HfxENSGO0z",
