                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We protect our kids from drugs, alcohol, and all sorts of things. And there\u2019s no question about the tragic effect that social media has on a child\u2019s mental health.\n\nIt\u2019s time we move to protect them once again.",
