                "text": "It was a privilege to visit @UUtah this morning and speak with such a great group of students.\n\nWe talked about the critical issues facing their generation, from the national debt to social media and mental health. We have a lot of work to do, but I know we can do it together. https://t.co/q5tBrlFRpK",
